479
00:34:33.640 --> 00:34:35.376
Ito ba ay puting bigas na may gochujang?

480
00:34:38.520 --> 00:34:39.333
Ano ang...

481
00:34:40.803 --> 00:34:42.323
Kayong mga country bumpkin ay dumating upang maglaro sa Seoul!

482
00:34:58.510 --> 00:35:00.959
F***, ano ba.

483
00:35:00.960 --> 00:35:03.449
